/td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.81 (0.47&#x02013;4.68)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">14.06 (0.01&#x02013;80.62)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3.37 (2.53&#x02013;4.41)</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>